    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etogolong'aka enkaiguanani Fashiti olaiguanani Serser",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.4.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esr 4.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore apa too nkolong'i e Serser, Serser laa ninye apa oitore ebaiki India ometabaiki Etiopia, ilkerenketi oobaya iip o tikitam oopishana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nena olong'i ina kata pee eton olaiguanani Serser to lorika lenye le nkitoo te Susa, naa ninye enkang kitok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore to lari liokuni le nkitoria enye neitobiraki osirua ilkituaak lenyena, o sinkan, Netii sii ilkituaak le njore le Parsia o Media o larikok o laiguanak loo lkerenketi dukuya ninye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ina kata eitoduaya enkarsisisho e nkitoo enye e nkisisa, o enkishiaa e nkitoo enye too nkolong'i kumok. Inkolong'i iip o ntomoni isiet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee ebaya nena olong'i, neisho olaiguanani lelo tung'ana pooki ootii Susa, ina ang kitok, ilkituaak o looti osirua too nkolong'i naapishana, ti atua enkaji e ntumo natii atua olgoriet le nkurma e ina manyisho o laiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii ilkarash ooibor o lpusi ooika eisiong'are iusin sidain naanyokie olgiso le nkosholai o ng'apeta naashetuno too soito oowang, netii sii ilorikan dapashi le sahabu o enkosholai shumata oleng'oti loo soito oonyokie o loonyori, netii isoito oogol enkinyang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neisho ninche metookisho too nkikompeni e sahabu oo mpukunot kumok, naa eisapuk oleng enaisho oo sabibu anaa enaikununo enkaminino o laiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eokore naa anaa enaitanapishoteki, mearakini hoo ng'ae, amu eitanapishe olaiguanani too lkituaak lenyena pooki ootii enkaji enye e nkitoo nchere nchoo metaasa pooki tung'ani enayieu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neisho sii Fashiti ina kitok o laiguanani inkituaak o sirua te ina aji e nkitoo o laiguanani Serser.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkolong' e naapishana, etishipe oltau lo laiguanani te nkaraki enaisho oo sabibu, neitanap ninye Mehuman, o Bista, o Harbona, o Bigta, o Abaguta o Setar o Karkas, lelo sunaishi oogelema oopishana ooisiaisho te dukuya olaiguanani Serser, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pee eyau Fashiti dukuya olaiguanani eishopito emaupe enye e nkitoo pee eitodol iltung'ana pooki o lkituaak pooki e nkishiaa enye, amu eisidai apa oleng te nking'urata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etanya apa Fashiti ina kitok o laiguanani, elotu te ina kitanapata o laiguanani anaa enatolimutuo lelo sunaishi oogelema. Neitagor ina olaiguanani oleng, netiu engoro enye anaa enkima nayupuyup ti atua ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki olaiguanani ilang'eni ooyiolo nkatitin, amu ilo apa olkerreti lo laiguanani ti alo lelo pooki arriyiak too nkitanapat o te nkiguana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa iltung'ana ootashare ninye naa Karshena o Shetar, o Admata, o Tarshish, o Meres, o Marsena, o Memukan, lelo kituaak oopishana le Parsia o Media, ootoduaa enkomom o laiguanani, naa ninche ootang'asa aatoni te nkitoo enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki, “Amaa te risioroto oo nkitanapat kaa eitaasi Fashiti amu eitu eas enaitanapa olaiguanani Serser natolikitio lelo sunaishi oogelema?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Memukan te dukuya olaiguanani o lelo kituaak, “Mme ake olaiguanani eitaasa Fashiti entorrono, kake eitaasa sii ilkituaak pooki o ltung'ana pooki ootii iloshon pooki lo laiguanani Serser. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore ena yasata e ina kitok o laiguanani naa keyiolou nkituaak pooki, nemenu ilpayiani lenye, te neimakini aajo eitanapishe olaiguanani Serser ajo meyauni Fashiti dukuya enye, neany elotu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ninye taata ena olong ntomonok e Parsia o Media naaidipa aatoning olkuak le nkitok o laiguanani naa keliki ilkituaak pooki lo laiguanani, neaku sapuk olmena o engoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tenaa keitiship ena olaiguanani, nchoo epukunye ninye enkitanapata, neigeri too nkitanapat oo Lpasia o Lmedia pee meibelekenyi, nchere meitoki ae kata Fashiti alotu dukuya Serser, naa nchoo eisho olaiguanani erishata enye e nkitoo esupat alang ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee einosuni aaibalunye ina kitanapata o laiguanani ti atua enkitoo enye pooki, aa sapuk anaa enatiu, pee eisho nkituaak enkanyit ilpayiani lenye, lkituaak o looti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitiship ena utaroto olaiguanani, o lkituaak, neas olaiguanani anaa enatolimuo Memukan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirriwaa mpala iloshon pooki le nkitoria enye, olosho ake too lkigeroto lenye o te nkutuk enkiroroto enye, nchere pee eaku olee ake ninye pooki olaitoriani le nkaji enye, neiro te risioroto enkutuk o lorere lenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
